# RIMMSQOL and the shared steps that drive its real MainButtons list. The dedicated avec-rimmsqol pass selects
# 20-rimmsqol-shortcut.feature; the requirement tags keep it from being counted in a pass where RIMMSQOL or the steps
# are absent.
#
# Not something this mod wrote. The steps are PickleTools/RimmsqolSteps, and the demonstration this feature is adapted
# from is SkillIcons' 17-rimmsqol-shortcut.feature. What this mod owes RIMMSQOL is that its shortcut is one RIMMSQOL can
# list and reveal (MOD_SETTINGS.md), and that is all this pass asserts. RIMMSQOL is kept out of the pass with the
# neighbours on purpose: it changes the main bar, which none of the bill features looks at, and one pass per concern
# says which mod a red belongs to.
#
# The folder PickleTools has to be cloned beside the mods under exactly that name: the path below is relative to the
# collection's root, and the folder's own About.xml packageId must equal the one written here.
MalteSchulze.RIMMSqol            1084452457
nelim.pickletools.rimmsqol       path:PickleTools/RimmsqolSteps/Mod
